      "created_at": "2023-02-22T14:01:24.871Z",
      "cooked": "<p>The classic villain in the classic environment - Advanced Baron Blade vs. G.I. Bunker, Rook City Wraith, Eternal Haka, Visionary Unleashed and Redeemer Fanatic in Insula Primalis.</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/5/544ec3cbb090c1c305603084eca33a9c742ad12f.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/544ec3cbb090c1c305603084eca33a9c742ad12f\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/5/544ec3cbb090c1c305603084eca33a9c742ad12f_2_231x500.jpeg\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"c1ORliQVMJnZifVZVQC2Yoac93h\" width=\"231\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/5/544ec3cbb090c1c305603084eca33a9c742ad12f_2_231x500.jpeg, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/5/544ec3cbb090c1c305603084eca33a9c742ad12f_2_346x750.jpeg 1.5x, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/5/544ec3cbb090c1c305603084eca33a9c742ad12f_2_462x1000.jpeg 2x\" data-small-upload=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/5/544ec3cbb090c1c305603084eca33a9c742ad12f_2_10x10.png\"><div class=\"meta\">\n<svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">828×1792 113 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg>\n</div></a></div></p>\n<p>Nothing terribly new here, as is expected. The game didn’t last a full four rounds against this horde of heavy hitters and Baron Blade was extremely ineffective, even on his advanced setting. Enjoy the easy week after last week’s bruiser.</p>",
