      "username": "Thunderbird",
      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/t/ba8739/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2023-02-23T13:50:25.366Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Wow, nice HP totals there for a Mint, OP!</p>\n<p>I got Mint as well, but with low single digits for everyone. 12 in BB’s trash before the flip, then just left two Obsidian Fields in play so his DR didn’t really matter. It hurt really bad when two Hasten Dooms and a Devious Disruption struck in one turn, but I won the damage race with no one going down.</p>",
