      "created_at": "2023-02-24T00:47:48.035Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Scientific method doesn’t fit with the saying at all… because the saying is “doing the same thing over and over, and <em>expecting</em> different results”. If you’re doing that with science, it’s bad science.</p>\n<p>Anyways, here’s my Mint:<br>\n<div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/7/70e5a518f5cc0a4c524bc167e83bcfdfd821f243.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/70e5a518f5cc0a4c524bc167e83bcfdfd821f243\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/7/70e5a518f5cc0a4c524bc167e83bcfdfd821f243_2_231x500.jpeg\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"g6JuilRZQOv0oJu01ISXEkR6V59\" width=\"231\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/7/70e5a518f5cc0a4c524bc167e83bcfdfd821f243_2_231x500.jpeg, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/7/70e5a518f5cc0a4c524bc167e83bcfdfd821f243_2_346x750.jpeg 1.5x, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/7/70e5a518f5cc0a4c524bc167e83bcfdfd821f243_2_462x1000.jpeg 2x\" data-small-upload=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/7/70e5a518f5cc0a4c524bc167e83bcfdfd821f243_2_10x10.png\"><div class=\"meta\">\n<svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1170×2532 194 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg>\n</div></a></div></p>\n<p>Haka got the perfect hand for taking out the double MDP and hitting Baron Blade for extra measure!</p>",
